<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile rejects bids for manganese metal.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile rejects bids for manganese metal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it made no award for electrolytic manganese metal following the offers it received June 24.</p>
<p>The next offering will be July 22.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
